{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/Small_Capsule_LONE_SUVIVOR.png?t=1746477230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lone Survivors is a objective and time-based survivors game. Fight off hordes of enemies with weapons that automatically attack, while you use a <i>single class-specific ability</i> to help you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Unlock Unique Abilities That Fight For You\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/abilities_row.png?t=1746477230\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout each adventure in a level, you will be offered the opportunity to select from a variety of weaponry, magic, and traps to defeat your enemies, <strong>featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 unique classes, each with their own progression trees - play as a Barbarian, a Warrior, a Mage, or even a Necromancer!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 13 unique weapons, each with their own legendary upgrades and special rare upgrades - from explosive Dynamite to chilling Ice Spikes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 30 unique meta-progression upgrades - ranging from Electrically Charged Turrets to making yourself a Rage-Infused Barbarian!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/choices.gif?t=1746477230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Battle in Unique Locations and Fight a Variety of Monsters\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the campaign mode, completing objectives to uncover the mystery of the island you are on, to an endless mode where you battle until the enemies overwhelm you to achieve the highest survival time, there is endless content to keep you engaged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/bottom_of_the_page_LONE_SUVIVOR.png?t=1746477230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Three unique biomes, with six different Locations within the Biomes, one for Endless and one for Survival each! Traverse through a forest, a deadly trap-filled dungeon, and the fiery pits of a volcano!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 20 different types of enemies - from Rats to Ghouls to Wizards and Floating Skulls!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Six Bosses to overcome, with plenty of Unique Elite enemies to encounter along the way!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend to higher difficulties after completing the game, providing even more challenge with additional boss phases, new types of enemies, and greater the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/ascension.gif?t=1746477230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629280?t=1746477230","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/d91241e4a2aaa2497de92f1b07a9342926f9c462/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746477230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/c05ed219035670bfbc8963083ede0035ab30dfb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746477230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/c05ed219035670bfbc8963083ede0035ab30dfb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746477230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/Small_Capsule_LONE_SUVIVOR.png?t=1746477230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lone Survivors is a objective and time-based survivors game. Fight off hordes of enemies with weapons that automatically attack, while you use a <i>single class-specific ability</i> to help you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Unlock Unique Abilities That Fight For You\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/abilities_row.png?t=1746477230\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout each adventure in a level, you will be offered the opportunity to select from a variety of weaponry, magic, and traps to defeat your enemies, <strong>featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 unique classes, each with their own progression trees - play as a Barbarian, a Warrior, a Mage, or even a Necromancer!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 13 unique weapons, each with their own legendary upgrades and special rare upgrades - from explosive Dynamite to chilling Ice Spikes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 30 unique meta-progression upgrades - ranging from Electrically Charged Turrets to making yourself a Rage-Infused Barbarian!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/choices.gif?t=1746477230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Battle in Unique Locations and Fight a Variety of Monsters\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the campaign mode, completing objectives to uncover the mystery of the island you are on, to an endless mode where you battle until the enemies overwhelm you to achieve the highest survival time, there is endless content to keep you engaged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/bottom_of_the_page_LONE_SUVIVOR.png?t=1746477230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Featuring</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Three unique biomes, with six different Locations within the Biomes, one for Endless and one for Survival each! Traverse through a forest, a deadly trap-filled dungeon, and the fiery pits of a volcano!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 20 different types of enemies - from Rats to Ghouls to Wizards and Floating Skulls!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Six Bosses to overcome, with plenty of Unique Elite enemies to encounter along the way!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend to higher difficulties after completing the game, providing even more challenge with additional boss phases, new types of enemies, and greater the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/extras/ascension.gif?t=1746477230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["GreatColtini Industries"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629280/8a8940ab1369a4332bf733cc3b28cba259689783/header.jpg?t=1746477230","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135349,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135349/movie480.mp4?t=1746477228","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135349/movie_max.mp4?t=1746477228"},"name":"Lone Survivors - Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135349/f8b39acaa2d65c02133de0a581c3e4b33aa72700/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746477228","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135349/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746477228","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135349/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746477228"}}],"name":"Lone Survivors","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["GreatColtini Industries"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"V